@startuml Interactive_Mode_Sequence

title Interactive Mode - LangGraph Q&A Flow

actor User
participant "Streamlit\nInteractive Mode" as UI
participant "FastAPI\n/api/interview/*" as API
participant "LangGraph\nStateGraph" as Graph
participant "ask_question\nNode" as NodeAsk
participant "evaluate_answer\nNode" as NodeEval
participant "generate_summary\nNode" as NodeSummary
participant "Groq LLM\nAPI" as LLM
database "MemorySaver\n(State)" as State

== Session Initialization ==
User -> UI: Switch to Interactive Mode
UI -> UI: Check analysis_result exists
User -> UI: Click "Start Interview"

UI -> API: POST /api/interview/start\n{crewai_result, job_description,\nuser_cv, company_name}
activate API

API -> API: parse_crewai_questions()\nExtract & format questions

API -> Graph: create_initial_state()\nInitialize InterviewState
activate Graph

Graph -> State: Save initial state\n(thread_id: uuid)
State --> Graph: State persisted

Graph -> NodeAsk: Execute ask_question
activate NodeAsk

NodeAsk -> NodeAsk: Get questions[0]
NodeAsk -> NodeAsk: Create AIMessage
NodeAsk -> State: Update chat_history\nSet awaiting_user_input=True
NodeAsk --> Graph: State updated
deactivate NodeAsk

Graph --> API: Return state\n{first_question, total_questions}
deactivate Graph

API --> UI: HTTP 200\n{thread_id, first_question,\ntotal_questions, question_number}
deactivate API

UI --> User: Display Question 1\n+ Progress bar\n+ Answer input

== Q&A Loop (Repeat for each question) ==
User -> UI: Type answer
User -> UI: Click "Submit Answer"

UI -> API: POST /api/interview/chat/{thread_id}\n{answer: "..."}
activate API

API -> Graph: get_state(thread_id)
activate Graph
Graph -> State: Load state
State --> Graph: Current state

Graph -> Graph: Add HumanMessage(answer)\nto chat_history

Graph -> NodeEval: Execute evaluate_answer
activate NodeEval

NodeEval -> NodeEval: Extract user's answer\nfrom chat_history

NodeEval -> NodeEval: Get current question\nDetermine type (technical/behavioral)

alt Technical Question
    NodeEval -> LLM: Evaluate technical answer\n(EVALUATE_TECHNICAL_ANSWER_PROMPT)
    activate LLM
    LLM --> NodeEval: {score, strengths,\nimprovements, feedback}
    deactivate LLM
else Behavioral Question
    NodeEval -> LLM: Evaluate behavioral answer\n(EVALUATE_BEHAVIORAL_ANSWER_PROMPT)
    activate LLM
    LLM --> NodeEval: {score, star_analysis,\nstrengths, improvements, feedback}
    deactivate LLM
end

NodeEval -> NodeEval: Create score_entry\n{question_index, score, feedback}

NodeEval -> State: Update state:\n- scores.append(score_entry)\n- current_index++\n- current_feedback
State --> NodeEval: State updated

NodeEval --> Graph: Evaluation complete
deactivate NodeEval

Graph -> Graph: determine_next_step()

alt More Questions Remain
    Graph -> NodeAsk: Execute ask_question
    activate NodeAsk
    NodeAsk -> NodeAsk: Get questions[current_index]
    NodeAsk -> State: Update chat_history\nwith next question
    NodeAsk --> Graph: Next question ready
    deactivate NodeAsk
    
    Graph --> API: Return state\n{feedback, next_question,\nprogress, interview_complete: false}
    
else All Questions Answered
    Graph -> NodeSummary: Execute generate_summary
    activate NodeSummary
    
    NodeSummary -> NodeSummary: Calculate averages:\n- technical_avg\n- behavioral_avg\n- overall_avg
    
    NodeSummary -> LLM: Generate summary\n(GENERATE_SUMMARY_PROMPT)
    activate LLM
    LLM --> NodeSummary: {overall_score, strengths,\nareas_for_improvement,\nrecommendations}
    deactivate LLM
    
    NodeSummary -> State: Update state:\n- final_summary\n- interview_complete=True
    State --> NodeSummary: State updated
    
    NodeSummary --> Graph: Summary complete
    deactivate NodeSummary
    
    Graph --> API: Return state\n{feedback, interview_complete: true}
end

deactivate Graph

API --> UI: HTTP 200\n{feedback, next_question,\nprogress, interview_complete}
deactivate API

UI -> UI: Add to interview_history
UI -> UI: Update progress

alt Interview Not Complete
    UI --> User: Show feedback\n+ Next question
    note right: Loop back to "Type answer"
else Interview Complete
    UI --> User: Show "Interview Complete!"
    User -> UI: View summary
    
    UI -> API: GET /api/interview/summary/{thread_id}
    activate API
    API -> Graph: get_state(thread_id)
    activate Graph
    Graph -> State: Load final state
    State --> Graph: State with final_summary
    Graph --> API: Return final_summary
    deactivate Graph
    API --> UI: HTTP 200\n{overall_score, strengths,\nareas_for_improvement,\nrecommendations, detailed_scores}
    deactivate API
    
    UI --> User: Display Final Summary:\n- Overall Score\n- Performance Breakdown\n- Strengths\n- Improvements\n- Recommendations
end

@enduml
